  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Scannable
  displayName: Reaper
  scientificName: Piscis Interfector
  description: The Reaper is white as chalk and moves with the unhurried elegance
    of something that has never once, in its entire existence, needed to hurry. Its
    great coral-red appendages trail behind it like the sleeves of an opera cloak.
    The teeth are visible at some distance. I have recorded this entry from what
    I consider to be a perfectly reasonable remove, and I stand by that decision
    entirely.
  journalImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9128a16bd035ead448668069711cec66, type: 3}
